  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "trap several enemies in a separate domain, granting self various boosts",
    "skill1": "sweeping AoE damage crosses the entire battlefield",
    "skill2": "fire multiple projectiles at target, dealing damage",
    "skill3": "ATK grows the longer shield stays active",
    "skill4": "deal massive damage each time enemies enter domain; only self can cast ultimate within",
    "skill5": "instantly defeat weakened enemies inside domain"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Cryonaia]] traps several enemies in a **winter domain**, gaining shields, control immunity, Haste, and ATK while it lasts. Only she can cast her ultimate inside, and weakened foes can be instantly defeated. Enemies entering the domain take heavy damage, while sweeping area attacks and projectiles chip priority targets. Her ATK grows while the shield holds, rewarding protection during the setup. She is vulnerable before the first ultimate, and breaking the shield or denying the grouping can end the domain before its execute triggers.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Cryonaia]] needs a **wind-up** before her winter domain traps top damage dealers and enables execute thresholds. On the opening beat, interrupt the high-damage ultimate with [[Lily May]]; if [[Niru]] catches that interrupt, pair [[Pandora]] with [[Lily May]] for a second attempt. Delete [[Cryonaia]] during the early setup with [[filter:backline-assassin]] like [[Ravion]] or [[Himmel]]. If the domain is already active, avoid relying on ultimates and use non-ultimate pressure from [[Gwyneth]] while waiting out the trap."
}
